@startuml layers
title CleanArchTemplate — layers and the dependency rule

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Helvetica"

package "Presentation" {
  [Api\ncontrollers · auth · rate limiting\nOpenAPI · optional gRPC] as Api
  [Migrator\nmigrations · topics · admin seed] as Migrator
  [Worker\noutbox drain · consumers · jobs] as Worker
}

package "Core" {
  [Application\ncommands · queries · handlers\nbehaviours · ports] as Application
  [Domain\naggregates · value objects\ndomain events · invariants] as Domain
  [Contracts\nintegration events · topics] as Contracts
}

package "Adapters" {
  [Infrastructure\nEF Core · Kafka · Redis\nJWT · SMTP · outbox] as Infrastructure
}

Api --> Application
Api --> Infrastructure
Migrator --> Infrastructure
Worker --> Infrastructure

Infrastructure --> Application : implements ports
Application --> Domain
Application --> Contracts
Infrastructure ..> Contracts

note right of Domain
  No dependencies at all.
  Testable without a database,
  a broker or a web host.
end note

note bottom of Infrastructure
  Depends inward on Application
  and supplies the adapters for
  the ports it declares.
end note

@enduml
